WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.201
-This is how this works.

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:05.472
We are going to have a number of
mystery objects brought out

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:08.641
in front of us, and our job
is to guess what each one is.

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:11.544
The catch is that we have to
figure it out by touch alone.

00:00:11.544 --> 00:00:12.745
-Oh, my gosh.
-I know, I know.

00:00:12.745 --> 00:00:14.180
I'm freaking out.
Alright, alright, alright.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.448
Reese, since you're my guest,
you'll go first.

00:00:16.448 --> 00:00:17.650
-What?!
-Yeah.

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.485
Let's bring in
our first object here.

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:22.221
You'll have 30 seconds
to identify what this is.

00:00:22.221 --> 00:00:24.858
You just put your hands in
that -- in the thing there.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:28.193
And...
-There's a strong smell.

00:00:28.193 --> 00:00:32.598
There's a strong smell! Aah!
It's smells really bad.

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.434
Hey!

00:00:34.434 --> 00:00:35.635
Aah!
-Aah!

00:00:35.635 --> 00:00:36.669
-I'm scared!

00:00:36.669 --> 00:00:37.703
-No, don't!

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:39.472
-Okay, I got to just do it.
Okay.

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:43.910
-Oh!
♪♪

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.446
Okay. It's like pudding
or something

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.683
with, like, graham crackers?

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:52.918
-Yeah, something like that.
-Graham-cracker pudding?

00:00:52.918 --> 00:00:54.921
-I think I'll give her
credit for that, right?

00:00:54.921 --> 00:00:56.288
-Melted chocolate
or melted candy.

00:00:56.288 --> 00:00:57.390
-Yes, yes.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:58.524
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:58.524 --> 00:01:01.026
[ Dinging ]
There's a towel right there.

00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:04.530
You'll get it -- Snickers bars.
You got an easy one.

00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:07.400
-Oh, that looks nasty.
-So gross. Yeah. All right.

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.669
Here we go. All right.
Now it's my turn.

00:01:09.669 --> 00:01:11.503
Oh, God.
-Oh, yeah. Okay, okay.

00:01:11.503 --> 00:01:15.842
-Ooh!
♪♪

00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:18.711
-Can I look at it?
-Mm-hmm.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:23.116
-Oh. Ew.
♪♪

00:01:23.116 --> 00:01:25.684
Yuck!

00:01:25.684 --> 00:01:27.753
Ew!

00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:29.255
That's disgusting.
-Why would you say, "Ew"?

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:34.394
It's disgusting? Ew!
-Yeah.

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:37.863
Aah! Oh, oh!

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:38.898
Oh, okay.
-Stop.

00:01:38.898 --> 00:01:40.099
I'm looking at the people
in the audience,

00:01:40.099 --> 00:01:43.369
and they're freaking me out.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.937
Ugh!
-Wait. Is it moving?

00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:50.310
-No, it's not moving!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.880
-Oh, my God!
-Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop!

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.382
Just stop it right now.
Just stop it!

00:01:56.382 --> 00:01:58.117
Oh, my gosh!

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:00.186
Just everyone -- Just stop
hitting the cymbal.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:03.889
It's just freaking me out. Gosh!
All right.

00:02:03.889 --> 00:02:08.794
-Oh!

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:11.163
Yeah, you're getting close.
You're getting closer.

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:13.933
Okay, okay, okay.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:17.070
Aah! Aah!

00:02:21.107 --> 00:02:24.144
Aah! Aah! You have it.
You have it.

00:02:24.144 --> 00:02:27.146
-I have no idea
what this thing is.

00:02:27.146 --> 00:02:31.550
Is it...

00:02:31.550 --> 00:02:32.719
Oh, is it a gourd?
-Yeah.

00:02:32.719 --> 00:02:33.953
[ Dinging ]

00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:39.659
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:40.926
-It's your acting.

00:02:40.926 --> 00:02:43.629
It's your acting
that got me all upset. Alright.

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:46.699
Reese, it's your turn now.
Here we go.

00:02:46.699 --> 00:02:49.335
I don't want to see this.
-Okay.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:52.138
-[ Laughing ] Yeah!

00:02:56.242 --> 00:03:01.480
-Okay. I'm a little nervous.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:06.085
Aah! Is it breathing?
Is it breathing?

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:09.989
-No!
-Aah!

00:03:09.989 --> 00:03:13.526
-Oh!
Oh, my goodness! Oh, my God!

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:16.929
-Shut up! Shut up!
-Ew!

00:03:16.929 --> 00:03:18.731
-There's nothing there.

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:21.567
-There's nothing there,
but something's there!

00:03:21.567 --> 00:03:27.440
-My arms are too short.
-I hope it doesn't...

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.609
-[ Laughing ] My arms are too...

00:03:34.713 --> 00:03:39.985
-Put it back in.
-I can't touch it.

00:03:39.985 --> 00:03:42.187
Oh, my God.
Is that a mouth guard?

00:03:42.187 --> 00:03:43.388
-Yeah, something like that.
It's teeth.

00:03:43.388 --> 00:03:45.624
Yeah, it's fake teeth.

00:03:45.624 --> 00:03:50.896
Fake teeth. Fake teeth.
That was the funniest thing.

00:03:50.896 --> 00:03:52.031
Alright. I'm up again.
Here we go.

00:03:52.031 --> 00:03:55.368
-I have, like, T. rex arms.

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:58.438
Oh, my God. This is so funny.

00:04:01.607 --> 00:04:05.044
Oh, my God. Oh, my God!

00:04:09.548 --> 00:04:10.916
Can you take a pass?

00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:12.986
'Cause this is bad.

00:04:17.356 --> 00:04:18.557
[ Drumroll ]

00:04:18.557 --> 00:04:21.261
Oh, my God.
-Stop!

00:04:24.931 --> 00:04:27.132
-They always do -- They save
these weird ones for me,

00:04:27.132 --> 00:04:29.001
and I always hate it.

00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:34.039
Ooh! Is it moving?
-Mnh-mnh. Oh.

00:04:34.039 --> 00:04:35.708
Yeah, it was --
Whoa! It's moving.

00:04:35.708 --> 00:04:37.744
[ Both screaming ]

00:04:41.413 --> 00:04:44.550
-Is that --
Is there a spider in there?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:47.086
-Yeah.
[ Dinging ]

00:04:47.086 --> 00:04:48.921
-I got it?
-Yeah, you got it.

00:04:48.921 --> 00:04:51.957
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:04:51.957 --> 00:04:55.261
It's not real. This is so funny,
this game.

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:56.629
-God, it's not real.

00:04:56.629 --> 00:04:58.531
If that was a real spider,
I would have quit the show.

00:04:58.531 --> 00:05:02.034
I really would. Alright.
It's time for the final round.

00:05:02.034 --> 00:05:04.036
This one, we're both going
to get the same item,

00:05:04.036 --> 00:05:06.271
and the first person
to guess it wins, okay?

00:05:06.271 --> 00:05:07.406
You put one arm in there.

00:05:07.406 --> 00:05:08.974
I put one arm in this one.
-Okay.

00:05:08.974 --> 00:05:11.010
♪♪

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:18.718
[ Drumroll ]

00:05:18.718 --> 00:05:19.819
-Ew!
-What?

00:05:19.819 --> 00:05:21.653
-I can see it.
-You can see it?

00:05:21.653 --> 00:05:23.355
-It's up there.
-You just saw it?

00:05:23.355 --> 00:05:24.457
-Well, something is
looking at me,

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:28.661
but I don't know what it was.

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:33.832
-It has his eyes?
-It's looking at me.

00:05:33.832 --> 00:05:37.303
Alright.

00:05:37.303 --> 00:05:38.871
-Gosh.
[ Both scream ]

00:05:38.871 --> 00:05:41.573
Stop it! Is it moving?
Is it moving?

00:05:41.573 --> 00:05:46.212
It's moving. Oh, my gosh.

00:05:46.212 --> 00:05:48.147
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:48.147 --> 00:05:51.851
-Okay. Okay, okay.

00:05:51.851 --> 00:05:53.886
-Alright.

00:05:53.886 --> 00:05:57.456
Aah! It's moving,
it's moving, it's moving!

00:05:57.456 --> 00:06:00.292
It's moving, it's moving.
I saw something moving.

00:06:00.292 --> 00:06:03.195
Oh, my gosh! I saw it, too.
It's moving.

00:06:03.195 --> 00:06:06.132
-Okay, we just have to do this.
-Yep. Alright, go.

00:06:06.132 --> 00:06:09.435
-3, 2, 1, go.
[ Both screaming ]

00:06:23.849 --> 00:06:26.752
-There's a person in there.
What are you doing?

00:06:26.752 --> 00:06:29.121
My thanks to Reese Witherspoon.
Stick around.

00:06:29.121 --> 00:06:30.856
We're talking to Reese
after the break.

00:06:30.856 --> 00:06:32.391
-That was crazy.
-Dude.

00:06:32.391 --> 00:06:37.397
-That was crazy. That was crazy.
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

